<title>SIERRA LEONE: SOCCER-SIERRA LEONE BEAT GABON 1-0 IN WORLD CUP TIE.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SIERRA LEONE BEAT GABON 1-0 IN WORLD CUP TIE.</headline>
<dateline>FREETOWN 1997-01-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sierra Leone beat Gabon 1-0 (halftime 0-0) in a World Cup African group five qualifying round match on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorer: Abu Kanu</p>
<p>Attendance: 40,000</p>
